Valkyries are no spellcaster character type (as I see by the subject that
you seem to know already), so spell proficiency is restricted compared to
e.g. wizards. They have attack and escape spells proficiency. The identify
spell is a divination spell, so you are restricted in it. Carrying spell
books around is not necessary; once you successfully read them you'll know
that spell (though knowledge is restricted by your current spell failure
rate) for 20.000 turns, then you will have to re-read the book (which you
can do a couple of times until it fades, i.e. turns blank).

